<title>SINGAPORE: Berger 1996 net profit falls 49.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Berger 1996 net profit falls 49.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996 (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   2.52  vs    5.00</p>
<p>    Final dividend (percent)	 0.50  vs    1.50</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		  2.43  vs    4.81</p>
<p>    Turnover			   130.32  vs  109.91</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest    1.44  vs    0.36</p>
<p>    Interest expense		   1.85  vs    0.62</p>
<p>    Operating pre-tax profit	 4.41  vs    8.74</p>
<p>    Associates			   0.64  vs    0.71</p>
<p>    Tax				    2.13  vs    3.18</p>
<p>    Minorities			  (0.40) vs   (1.28)</p>
<p>Note -- Berger International Ltd is involved in the manufacturing, sales and distribution of paint and related products.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
